[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4800.39, "timestamp": "01:20:00", "text": "尽管。新的一季。呃，不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4802.149, "timestamp": "01:20:02", "text": "看来远处的土地已经恢复原状了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4812.229, "timestamp": "01:20:12", "text": "你玩过《命运1》吗？命运一？不。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4814.07, "timestamp": "01:20:14", "text": "《无处可逃》是一款没有……的狙击游戏"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4815.91, "timestamp": "01:20:15", "text": "范围。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4818.39, "timestamp": "01:20:18", "text": "无处可去。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4820.07, "timestamp": "01:20:20", "text": "是的，这是一把没有瞄准镜的狙击步枪。所以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4822.229, "timestamp": "01:20:22", "text": "就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4824.87, "timestamp": "01:20:24", "text": "嗯，是楼主。就是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4827.75, "timestamp": "01:20:27", "text": "哦，是《命运2》。好的。好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4833.23, "timestamp": "01:20:33", "text": "哦。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4836.709, "timestamp": "01:20:36", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4841.31, "timestamp": "01:20:41", "text": "哦，原来是同一把枪。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4857.79, "timestamp": "01:20:57", "text": "是啊，也许我会再玩一遍《命运2》。"}]